msgid "Only one bot per channel should greet. Two greeters welcome every newcomer twice, which is why a bot that stands in every room is set to greeting none. Keep the public line to one sentence: it is the only part of a welcome the whole room reads and the only part that persists. Everything a newcomer needs to learn belongs in the private half."
msgstr "Only one bot per channel should greet. Two greeters welcome every newcomer twice, which is why a bot that stands in every room is set to greeting none. Keep the public line to one sentence: it is the only part of a welcome the whole room reads and the only part that persists. Everything a newcomer needs to learn belongs in the private half."

